OL,3,GNEWSATeen completes GCSEs in five
OL,4,Amonths using his eyes
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor many teenagers awaiting their GCSE
OL,7,Fresults on Thursday, sitting their exam
OL,8,Fpapers took place over several weeks -
OL,9,Fbut for one 16-year-old from Cheshire,
OL,10,Fthe whole process took months while
OL,11,Fthey used their eye-gaze to answer the
OL,12,Fquestions.
OL,14,FPatrick, 16, has cerebral palsy and
OL,15,Fcompleted his exams over the course of
OL,16,Ffive months using eye-tracking
OL,17,Ftechnology.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
