OL,3,GNEWSATeen completes GCSEs in five
OL,4,Amonths using his eyes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a student at The Fallibroome
OL,7,FAcademy, in Macclesfield, Patrick began
OL,8,Ffilling out exam papers for his seven
OL,9,FGCSEs in February and completed them in
OL,10,FJune.
OL,12,FAhead of results day Patrick told BBC
OL,13,FBreakfast: "My ultimate dream is to
OL,14,Fwork in media and to be the next Claire
OL,15,FBalding on wheels."
